~ start

[speed=0.7]I helped Kuya get up here.[/speed]

[speed=0.6]But... he doesn't look happy.[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.7]...my gameboy.[/speed]

OLLIE: Huh?

DODONG: [speed=0.7]I dropped it... It fell into the water...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Kuya... you can get another one later.[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.1][shake rate=8 level=5][b]You don't get it! It was mine![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6]...[/speed]

[speed=0.6]He's really upset...[/speed]

[speed=0.6]I shouldn't say that.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Your leg... let me see.[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.8]It's fine.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.9][shake rate=3 level=2]But you're limping![/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.0][shake rate=8 level=5][b]I said it's fine![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]...You're bleeding.[/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.7][shake rate=3 level=2]Don't tell Tatay.[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.9][shake rate=5 level=3]What? But-[/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.0][shake rate=9 level=6][b]He'll just get mad! I already dropped my gameboy in the flood![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Tatay won't be mad at you for getting hurt...[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.7]You don't know that.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Let me see. Please.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6]...[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=3 level=2]There's so much blood...[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=3]Why won't it stop?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.8][shake rate=8 level=5]Oh no... What do I do?[/shake][/speed]

if Inventory.has_item("medkit")
	OLLIE: [speed=0.8]The medkit... I knew I'd need it.[/speed]
	OLLIE: [speed=0.9][shake rate=3 level=2]Hold still, Kuya. This is going to sting.[/shake][/speed]
else
	OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]I... I don't have anything.[/shake][/speed]
	OLLIE: [speed=1.0][shake rate=5 level=3]Wait. My sleeve. Hold still.[/shake][/speed]

=> END